  "notes": "The full 24-EDO quarter-tone grid. Load a maqam _24EDO mask over this, or use as a tuning. || Cent values after Sami Abu Shumays' maqam presets for Ableton Live 12 (tuning.ableton.com/arabic-maqam). Egypt/Greater Syria practice; one practitioner's deeply-informed version, NOT a universal standard. Maqam identity is melodic, not just the scale."
